{"id": "EUVD-2026-98677", "enisaUuid": "d892ef8a-6f2c-38b3-bdd9-b824dd69f612", "description": "Wazuh 4.14.3 before 4.14.8 contains a case-sensitivity mismatch between the ossec.conf validator and wazuh-logcollector that bypasses remote-command validation. Authenticated users with manager:update_config can inject an uppercase LOG_FORMAT command localfile that the collector runs as root on reload.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T13:27:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T14:14:38", "baseScore": 9.4, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:H/SI:H/SA:H", "references": ["https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh/security/advisories/GHSA-cjf8-wjx6-hjw6", "https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh/releases/tag/v4.14.8", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/wazuh-4.14.3-before-4.14.8-remote-command-validation-bypass-via-case-mismatch"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-74041"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.37, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "36adf0d5-b33d-3a4b-b4cf-4e29047d59d5", "product": {"name": "wazuh-manager", "vendor": {"name": "wazuh"}}, "product_version": "4.14.3 <4.14.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "36c28340-81f0-388a-b937-f30721581d86", "vendor": {"name": "wazuh"}}], "isExploited": false}